<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it expresses non-hierarchical associations between concepts of the controlled vocabularies. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS esprime associazioni semantiche non gerarchiche tra concetti dei vocabolari controllati. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "related"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "correlato"@it .
